	(text "microSD in SPI mode on SPI1, the BB48R's pins: DAT3 = CS (GPIO 9), CLK (10), CMD = MOSI (11),\nDAT0 = MISO (24). DAT1 and DAT2 pulled up. Card detect on GPIO 30 (new on rev C)."
